# Enquiry delivery — set ONE of these, or neither.
#
# With neither set, enquiries are logged to the server console and the visitor
# still sees a confirmation. That applies in development only — a production
# build with neither set returns an error rather than a false confirmation, so a
# missing or mistyped variable is caught instead of silently losing enquiries.

# Option A — POST the enquiry anywhere (Zapier, Make, a Slack webhook)
# ENQUIRY_WEBHOOK_URL=

# Option B — email via Resend (https://resend.com)
# RESEND_API_KEY=
# ENQUIRY_TO=info@beexplorerstravel.com
# ENQUIRY_FROM="BeExplorers <info@beexplorerstravel.com>"
